      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THE RUSSELL KANE SHOW FOR OCTOBER 24, 2025 HAS BEEN CANCELLED. &nbsp; Whirlwind, FitBit-breaking comedian, presenter, actor and author Russell Kane is out on the road again, setting it on fire with his unique recipe of sharp wit and “storming..."
