    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THE RUSSELL KANE SHOW FOR OCTOBER 24, 2025 HAS BEEN CANCELLED.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWhirlwind, FitBit-breaking comedian, presenter, actor and author Russell Kane is out on the road again, setting it on fire with his unique recipe of sharp wit and “storming physical comedy” (Mail on Sunday).\n\nThe brand-new tour for 2025 comes with a safety warning: wear strong underwear - pants will be spoiled. Russell is high-energy, high-octane, and hyper-active!\n\n‘Fierce, funny and heartfelt&amp;hellip; a thrilling reminder of what comedy can do.’ - The Guardian\n\n‘An evening-long fix of stand-up espresso... one of the quickest, most stimulating stand-ups in the land’ - The Times\n\n‘Russell Kane has made his name with verbose, hyperactive comedy – and he shows no sign of slowing down.’ - The Independent"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/doorTime": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "18:30"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P0DT3H0M"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EventCancelled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en_CA"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
