    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fossils, a Bengali hard rock band, is widely regarded as one of the seminal rock acts within the Bengali music landscape. The band&#8217;s current members include Rupam Islam (lead vocals, additional guitars), Deep Ghosh (rhythm guitar), Allan Temjen Ao (lead..."
