      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Outback Presents & Off The Kerb Productions are thrilled to announce that after more than two decades of packed arenas, five critically-acclaimed tours, and over 1.5 million tickets sold worldwide, Kevin Bridges—one of the UK’s most celebrated comedians—is coming to North America with his Live tour this fall with a stop in Calgary, AB at"
