    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "KEVIN BRIDGES: LIVE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Outback Presents &amp; Off The Kerb Productions are thrilled to announce that after more than two decades of packed arenas, five critically-acclaimed tours, and over 1.5 million tickets sold worldwide, Kevin Bridges—one of the UK’s most celebrated comedians—is coming to..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Outback Presents &amp; Off The Kerb Productions are thrilled to announce that after more than two decades of packed arenas, five critically-acclaimed tours, and over 1.5 million tickets sold worldwide, Kevin Bridges—one of the UK’s most celebrated comedians—is coming to North America with his Live tour this fall with a stop in Calgary, AB at the MacEwan Hall on Friday, September 19, 2025. Tickets go on-sale Friday, June 13 @ MacEwan Hall.\n\nWith five stand-up specials, including the cinematic release of his latest show The Overdue Catch-Up, and two best- selling books, Kevin Bridges is a comedic force whose sharp wit and relatable storytelling have made him a household name across the UK and beyond. Now, for the first time ever, Canadian audiences will get to experience his signature brand of comedy—live on stage.\n\nBridges has performed to sold-out crowds across Europe, Australia, New Zealand, and the Middle East. Known for his observational humour and effortless delivery, his shows are a masterclass in stand-up. From New Brunswick to British Columbia, Kevin is hitting the road for a nationwide tour that promises fresh laughs, unforgettable moments, and the same powerhouse performance style that has made him a global sensation.\n\nAGE RESTRICTION: STRICTLY 14+ Potential swearing and adult content"
      }
    ],
