    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Slava Vakarchuk: New Yet Familiar Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A concert that feels like a reunion of old friends, where the music speaks all the words your hearts need to hear. The past few years have transformed us all, and the music has evolved with us. Slava Vakarchuk’s solo..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A concert that feels like a reunion of old friends, where the music speaks all the words your hearts need to hear. The past few years have transformed us all, and the music has evolved with us.\n\nSlava Vakarchuk’s solo performance offers a chance to embrace these changes, to feel them deeply, and to give them a voice.\n\nJoin us for an evening where the cherished songs of Okean Elzy and Slava’s solo projects resonate with renewed emotion. Acoustic guitar. Grand piano. An intimate setting where every note touches the soul.\n\nA portion of ticket proceeds will go toward supporting Ukraine’s resilience and spirit.\n\nCome to listen. To feel. To connect."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/doorTime": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "19:00"
