    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "with JAWNS B2B TISOKI and AUSTERIA ROM THE DARKNESS, COMES LIGHT. Deathpact crafts a multisensory universe; interactive, puzzle-laden online experiences, cryptic visual motifs, and an innovative sonic palette invites listeners to become part of an ever-expanding story. They remain the..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "with JAWNS B2B TISOKI and AUSTERIA\n\nROM THE DARKNESS, COMES LIGHT. Deathpact crafts a multisensory universe; interactive, puzzle-laden online experiences, cryptic visual motifs, and an innovative sonic palette invites listeners to become part of an ever-expanding story. They remain the anonymous harbinger of forward-thinking art, a reminder that FROM DARKNESS, LIGHT emerges – and with each release, the mystery deepens.\n\nCatch his return to Calgary, Friday March 7th at MacEwan Hall."
      }
    ],
