        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jon Dore &#038; Dave Merheje Comedy Tour *CANCELLED*"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The COMEDY HERE NOW show with Jon Dore &amp; Dave Merheje has been cancelled. Ticket holders will be notified and refunds issued at point of purchase.  Co-Headlining w/ Special Guests Two of Canada&#8217;s Juno winning comedic titans, Jon Dore (CBC&#8217;s &#8216;Humour Resources&#8217;,..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The COMEDY HERE NOW show with Jon Dore &amp; Dave Merheje has been cancelled. Ticket holders will be notified and refunds issued at point of purchase. \n\nCo-Headlining w/ Special Guests\n\nTwo of Canada's Juno winning comedic titans, Jon Dore (CBC's 'Humour Resources', The Jon Dore Television Show, &amp; Conan) and Dave Merheje ('I Love You Habibi' Crave special, 'Sometimes I Think About Dying' [2024] &amp; Hulu's 'Ramy') are bringing laughs coast to coast, featuring top acts from across the country, brought to you by Comedy Here Often? &amp; SiriusXM Comedy Club. Tour begins Fall 2024, so grab your tickets now at Live Nation for one of the funniest nights of your Canadian life!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/doorTime": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "19:00"
      }
