      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Fresh from emceeing Madonna’s The Celebration Tour, comedian Bob The Drag Queen is set to dazzle audiences with his first headline comedy world tour, THIS IS WILD! This tour marks a significant milestone for Bob, the winner of season 8 of RuPaul’s Drag Race, who has since evolved into a Peabody Award, GLAAD Media Award,"
      }
