    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Bob the Drag Queen: This Is Wild Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fresh from emceeing Madonna’s The Celebration Tour, comedian Bob The Drag Queen is set to dazzle audiences with his first headline comedy world tour, THIS IS WILD! This tour marks a significant milestone for Bob, the winner of season 8..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fresh from emceeing Madonna’s The Celebration Tour, comedian Bob The Drag Queen is set to dazzle audiences with his first headline comedy world tour, THIS IS WILD!\n\nThis tour marks a significant milestone for Bob, the winner of season 8 of RuPaul’s Drag Race, who has since evolved into a Peabody Award, GLAAD Media Award, and Television Academy Honors-winning artist for his contributions to HBO’s We’re Here. Beyond his television success, Bob has made waves as a musician with his debut EP ‘Gay Barz’, and as an acclaimed podcaster alongside Monét X Change on Sibling Rivalry.\n\nAimed at adults, this 18+ event will showcase Bob’s unparalleled ability to blend standup comedy, crowd work, and music, all while entertaining his audience with the charisma and flair he is renowned for.\n\nTHIS IS WILD! is more than just a comedy show; it’s an adventure into the heart of what makes Bob The Drag Queen a true icon in the world of entertainment.\n\nDon’t miss the opportunity toseeBob The Drag Queen–it is going to wild!"
      }
    ],
