    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This new show is a fun-fueled trip through the comic imagination of one of the best comedians in the world. This is a wild, uninhibited and fiercely physical display of stand-up. A madcap parade of characters, memories and ridiculous flights..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This new show is a fun-fueled trip through the comic imagination of one of the best comedians in the world. This is a wild, uninhibited and fiercely physical display of stand-up. A madcap parade of characters, memories and ridiculous flights of fancy. Theatrical, poetical and slightly unhinged.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n‘This holy man of having-a-laugh want to offer us something pure as well as silly, dreamlike as well as vulgar’ - The Times\n\n‘A well-executed symphony of laughs.’ – Georgia Straight\n\n‘I thought my head would fall off from laughing ****’ The Times\n\n\n\nThis event will be a phone-free experience. Use of phones, smart watches and accessories will not be permitted in the performance space. There will be phone-use areas inside the venue to check your device.\n\nUpon arrival at the venue, all phones, smart watches and accessories will be secured in individual Yondr pouches that will be opened at the end of the event. Guests maintain possession of their devices at all times, and can access them throughout the event only in designated Phone Use Areas within the venue. All devices will be re-secured in Yondr pouches before returning to the performance space.\n\nAnyone seen using a device (phone, smart watch or accessories) during the performance will be escorted out of the venue."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/doorTime": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "18:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P0DT3H30M"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en_CA"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
