        "@value": "The Teskey Brothers – The Winding Way Tour - MacHall Concerts"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Live Nation presents The Teskey Brothers with special guests Bella White Over the past 10 years Sam and Josh Teskey, known as The Teskey Brothers, have somehow, quite discreetly, captured the hearts of a massive global audience with their soulful take on blues, folk and rock. It’s an unexpected Australian story of raw, commanding talent"
      }
    ],
