    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Choir! Choir! Choir!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "with Special Guests “Why see a show when you can BE the show!” Choir! Choir! Choir! is the fully interactive, participatory show that turns audience into performer! So get ready to laugh, dance and SING! your hearts out with hundreds..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "with Special Guests\n\n“Why see a show when you can BE the show!”\n\nChoir! Choir! Choir! is the fully interactive, participatory show that turns audience into performer! So get ready to laugh, dance and SING! your hearts out with hundreds of other music-lovers just like you. It’s like a big birthday party for the greatest songs of all time and you’re invited!\n\nSo grab a friend (or ten), and come out ready to GIVE IT ALL YOU’VE GOT! - all voices welcome, no experience necessary. They Teach, You Sing! Everyone Wins!\n\nThis time, Choir!Choir!Choir! Presents: “Hallelujah”: An EPIC Anthems Sing-Along!\n\nEPIC anthems unite the world and are the soundtrack to our lives. And there is none more EPIC than Leonard Cohen’s “Hallelujah.” When a room, filled with hundreds (thousands?!) of strangers, starts to harmonize, you’ll feel it deep in your soul. And that’s not all! Get ready to sing your way through the greatest of the greatest songs of all-time; from Leonard and Joni, to Whitney and Shania, you’ll wanna SING them all!\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSince 2011, Choir! Choir! Choir! directors Daveed Goldman + Nobu Adilman have blurred the lines between performer and audience, traveling the world to create harmony with strangers and friends alike. They’ve collaborated with renowned artists like Patti Smith, David Byrne, Brandi Carlile, Rick Astley, Rufus Wainwright, and even Kermit The Frog at New York’s Lincoln Center, creating memorable videos that have garnered views in the millions. Now it’s your turn to SING!, so grab your friends, get your tickets and we’ll C! you there! #NeverStopSinging\n\n&nbsp;"
      }
    ],
