    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "With special guest ZINADELPHIA\n\n\n\nPackage details are subject to change without notice at any time. NO REFUNDS or EXCHANGES; all sales are final. All package elements will be rendered invalid if resold. The information and name listed at checkout will be the name on file with your VIP package. VIP details will be sent to the email address listed at purchase approximately 2-3 days prior to the event. If you have any questions regarding your VIP package order, please email our customer service team at support@granted.co\n\nVIP merchandise items will be distributed to fans at the show. Customers can contact support@granted.co with any questions concerning their package.\n\nThere is a strict 4 ticket limit for this event. Accounts found in violation of the posted ticket limit may be cancelled without notice.\n\nThis event has delayed the release of ticket information. You will see your ticket information here on March 7th."
      }
    ],
