    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TD Music Connected Series presents IKKY, Preston Pablo, Kuzi Cee, and LU KALA.  FREE SHOW!\n\nThe TD Music Connected Series is back in 2023 for free concerts in Vancouver, Toronto, Calgary, and Halifax.  Curated by Canada’s Music Incubator (CMI), the concert series will be featuring a variety of diverse artists from across the country.\n\nGet your tickets online and join us for an incredible celebration of Canadian Music!   Free tickets drop here on October 30 at 12pm."
      }
