        "@value": "JOANNE MCNALLY - MacHall Concerts"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Described by The Sunday Times as a 'truly gifted stand-up', Joanne has been taking Ireland's comedy scene by storm with sell out tours, hilarious chat show appearances, newspaper articles, and a hit documentary all under her belt. Now firmly on the UK comedy circuit, she's enjoyed sell out Edinburgh runs with her stand up shows"
      }
    ],
