        "@value": "Slava Komissarenko, a stand-up comedian from Belarus, will perform in Calgary on June 10th at MacEwan Hall stage with a new program. His YouTube videos are gaining millions of views, and his laid-back style of performances can charm and make..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Slava Komissarenko, a stand-up comedian from Belarus, will perform in Calgary on June 10th at MacEwan Hall stage with a new program. His YouTube videos are gaining millions of views, and his laid-back style of performances can charm and make even the most sullen viewer laugh. His powers of observation make simple speculations about everyday events truly funny. Today, Slava performs all over the world, supporting Ukraine and being a loud anti-war voice."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P0DT2H30M"
      }
