      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "** VENUE CHANGE: this event is now in the MacEwan Ballroom, upstairs from MacEwan Hall.\n\nRAPSEASON and MODO-LIVE Present:\n\ndvsn (pronounced “division”) is a alternative R&amp;B act based in Toronto, consisting of Daniel Daley and Nineteen85.\n\nOVO producer Nineteen85 brought dvsn into the limelight when he played “The Line” and “With Me” on the eighth OVO Sound Radio tracklist. The two singles were originally released on September 5, 2015 on their SoundCloud. They released their debut album SEPT 5TH on April 1, 2016 via OVO Sound/Warner Bros.\n\ndvsn made their debut live performance, performing at “The Fader Fort presented by Converse” as part of SXSW Music Festival.\n\n\n\nPre-sale information can be found on our @macewanhall Instagram"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P0DT2H30M"
      }
