      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Unfortunately we have to announce that we are canceling the BNXN fka Buju show slated for 21st May 2022. We were misinformed about the status of BNXN's Canadian Visa. We do not want to take the risk that his visa isn't processed before the show date, leading to our decision to cancel the event."
      }
