      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Unfortunately we have to announce that we are canceling the BNXN fka Buju show slated for 21st May 2022. We were misinformed about the status of BNXN&#8217;s Canadian Visa. We do not want to take the risk that his visa..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/about": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Unfortunately we have to announce that we are canceling the BNXN fka Buju show slated for 21st May 2022. We were misinformed about the status of BNXN's Canadian Visa. We do not want to take the risk that his visa isn't processed before the show date, leading to our decision to cancel the event. \n \nAll already purchased tickets will be refunded. \n \nThank you for understanding.\n\nRegards,\nFemi B.G. of Icarus Sound\n\nBNXN fka Buju is a shining star in the Afrobeats music scene.\n\nThe singer, songwriter, is admired for his sonorous voice and excellent songwriting ability that has propelled him to international stardom."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/duration": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P0DT2H30M"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en_CA"
      }
    ]
  },
