        "@value": "CAMO – *RESCHEDULED* - MacHall Concerts"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "CAMO FANS! We heard you and are excited to announce that we will be adding more cities on her first North American tour with stops in Los Angeles and San Francisco along with the previously announced shows in New York, Vancouver, and Calgary. In order to add these additional cities, the tour has ben scheduled"
      }
    ],
