        "@value": "Due to an unforeseen medical issue, Action Bronson will no longer be able to perform on the Western Canadian dates of the ÑBA LEATHER TOUR. Earl Sweatshirt will still be headlining along with support from The Alchemist and Boldy James. Refund requests will..."
