    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "With guests, Haley Blais. Through bad breakups, bouts of loneliness, existential crises, and even Pandemics, true friends stick around. Instead of bending and breaking, their bonds crystallize in the roughest of rough patches. If friendship had a sound, it would be Peach Pit. The wistful grooves, glassy guitars, and sun-kissed melodies feel like they could"
      }
